{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0142_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e6e39820937107fe6613cf2998d99fade7b214ee9aac773d95b8b6434972a79c", "ja": "……真美。この前の、俺のクッションに保冷剤を\n仕掛けたイタズラのことなんだがな……。", "zh": "……真美。关于上次在我坐垫里塞冰袋的\n那个恶作剧啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0142_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "4235a8087ee0bcb0e0435f83d9d747564deec50b3e8001d733ade2e37514052d", "ja": "えーっ！　ヒドいよ兄ちゃん！\nあれはイタズラじゃないんだってば～！", "zh": "诶——！太过分了，哥哥！\n都说了那不是恶作剧啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0142_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "362555e45046637f9bd233de7cc0eb203f3c404649f21bd2120460b38327cde9", "ja": "イタズラじゃなくて……。そうそう、兄ちゃんを\nネギラー油するためのドッキリだよ！", "zh": "不是恶作剧……对对，是为了给哥哥来个“葱辣油”惊喜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0142_1003_p", "source_sha256": "30239cf0fd14c4727717b4fc0c1d027e9f7beb168b58c666fb1159c9ad35c65a", "ja": "ね、ネギラー油？　ああ、「ねぎらう」な。\nでも、真美がねぎらうだなんて、突然どうしたんだ？", "zh": "葱辣油？啊，是“慰劳”啊。不过，真美居然会慰劳人，怎么突然想到这个了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0142_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "20bb91bc2dd8115f34fbe7b3ba403481ba3170b25b58011c711885ff53c11b18", "ja": "真美だってネギラウぐらいするよー！　兄ちゃん、\nいつも真美達のために、頑張ってくれてるっしょ？", "zh": "真美也会慰劳一下的嘛——！哥哥，你一直都在为真美她们努力，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0142_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "d654b7b3c3186a6aefe2837019c8c30f1de8545b80ea00db7f8329a86609a43d", "ja": "だから真美、たまには兄ちゃんをネギラって、\nお礼がしたいなーって思ったんだー。", "zh": "所以真美想着，偶尔也想慰劳一下哥哥，向你道谢嘛——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0142_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e1152018d57025dbeefc50d5c3df1911ef5882e2958d94edcbd4ff3e3d70e8dd", "ja": "あのドッキリのどこにねぎらいの要素があったのか、\nよくわからないんだが……。", "zh": "我实在没看出那个整蛊活动哪里有慰劳的成分……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0142_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "48fa0adecdbfcb4862b786fdfd2d28fdecf9a86fafceda047e77dfde75013e77", "ja": "オシリが冷え冷え～ってして気持ちよかったっしょ～？\nホットなプロデューサー魂も、クールビズしないと。", "zh": "屁股凉飕飕的～感觉很舒服吧～？\n火热的制作人之魂，也得来点清凉商务装才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0142_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8b83a71cd0f73ee826ba870815d28687937f32f3fc033ff7445b8b91ec90e2e0", "ja": "なるほど、そういうことだったのか……？　まあ、\n冷たくてビックリするから、次は先に教えてくれよ。", "zh": "原来是这么回事啊……？不过，\n因为太冷会吓一跳，下次可要先告诉我啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0142_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "2d7208fd29fb23e5a78dbb4a79a5943846d8d2dbb292d6ec6f169a148d8ee595", "ja": "ガッテン承知だよ兄ちゃん！　じゃあ今度は、\nアツアツの湯たんぽにしてあげんね♪　んっふっふ～！", "zh": "明白了，哥哥！那下次就给你做个热乎乎的热水袋♪嗯呼呼～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
